From d67a202e9c11b9794c9ebc624a422d46fe6e24eb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: guochao <jeffguorg@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 10:51:06 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] NEM: add PIC state restore regression tests

Add a VMMStatic-based test that executes the production PIC setter with wrapped ioctls, plus an opt-in real-KVM layer using a private VM and irqchip without creating or running vCPUs.

Both layers fail before the PIC GET/SET correction: the mock observes KVM_GET_IRQCHIP, and real-KVM readback retains the old interrupt mask. Forward the existing optional full-irqchip build define so production and tests use consistent declarations.
---
